    "name": "ESCAPE FROM TIMOKHA 2: ARMY",
    "steam_appid": 3554450,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timokha caught up with the plane on the way to the Maldives and showed his secret weapon! What is it?! Maybe a new kind of pie? No! This is a summons to an exciting journey to serve in the ranks of the Pie Federation! Tough quests with polishing the push and painting the grass green await you! Escape as soon as possible, because mom and dad are waiting for you at the resort! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an exciting and funny quest that will definitely cheer you up! You have inventory at your disposal, with which you will interact to solve puzzles. A variety of army tests await you:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1) Target shooting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2) Parkour <br>3) Speed \u200b\u200bfloor washing<br> 4) Push-ups and pull-ups <br>5) Cleaning ZIL wheels from sewage <br>6) Painting grass green <br><br>And ... Much more! Along the way, you will be pursued by the main villain Timokha and his GANG! Collect all the sausages, berries and potatoes to bake more BOGATYR pies! Save your beloved Ruzita! Refuel the plane, complete quests, have fun, follow orders and escape from Timokha Pirozhkov's military unit as soon as possible!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timokha caught up with the plane on the way to the Maldives and showed his secret weapon! What is it?! Maybe a new kind of pie? No! This is a summons to an exciting journey to serve in the ranks of the Pie Federation! Tough quests with polishing the push and painting the grass green await you! Escape as soon as possible, because mom and dad are waiting for you at the resort! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an exciting and funny quest that will definitely cheer you up! You have inventory at your disposal, with which you will interact to solve puzzles. A variety of army tests await you:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1) Target shooting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2) Parkour <br>3) Speed \u200b\u200bfloor washing<br> 4) Push-ups and pull-ups <br>5) Cleaning ZIL wheels from sewage <br>6) Painting grass green <br><br>And ... Much more! Along the way, you will be pursued by the main villain Timokha and his GANG! Collect all the sausages, berries and potatoes to bake more BOGATYR pies! Save your beloved Ruzita! Refuel the plane, complete quests, have fun, follow orders and escape from Timokha Pirozhkov's military unit as soon as possible!</p>",
    "short_description": "Pay your debt to the Pie Federation or RUN AWAY!",
    "supported_languages": "English, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
